    "text": "A stone is projected from a point on the ground in such a way so as to hit a bird at height <math><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;and could attain a maximum height <math><mn>4</mn><mi>h</mi></math> above the ground. If at the instant of projection, the bird flies away horizontally with speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp; and the stone still hits the bird while descending,&nbsp;then the horizontal velocity of stone&nbsp;is<br />\r<br />\r<img height=\"76\" src=\"assets\\qt0040_490a6f722575.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" width=\"224\" />"
